#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:1
msgid "Songjiang Data Elements Special Fund, second 2026 batch"
msgstr "2026松江区数据要素专项资金第二批"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:4
msgid "Grant / reimbursement | Songjiang"
msgstr "补助与费用补贴｜松江区"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:6
msgid "2026 call published; deadline check required"
msgstr "2026年通知已公布，需确认截止时间"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S135 "
"<https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/ztzl/005019/005019002/20260803/9bd36209-64ca-48b3-8e17-5c929ce97f1b.html>`_. "
"关于开展2026年度第二批松江区数据要素专项资金项目申报的通知."
msgstr "`资料来源 S135 <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/ztzl/005019/005019002/20260803/9bd36209-64ca-48b3-8e17-5c929ce97f1b.html>`_. 关于开展2026年度第二批松江区数据要素专项资金项目申报的通知."

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与支持方式"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:13
msgid ""
"Project-specific support under the district data-elements special fund "
"rules"
msgstr "依松江区数据要素专项资金管理办法按核定项目给予资助"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "申请条件与受理时间"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:20
msgid ""
"Lawfully operating Songjiang organizations developing high-quality "
"datasets, corpus governance, data-product listings or AI data-space "
"applications."
msgstr "在松江依法经营、开展高质量数据集建设、语料治理、数据产品挂牌或人工智能数据空间应用的单位。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:22
msgid ""
"Second 2026 batch notice issued August 2026; confirm current acceptance "
"status"
msgstr "2026年第二批通知于8月发布，需确认当前受理状态"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "咨询与申请"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请渠道及政策文件 <https://www.songjiang.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所附链接联系主管部门或运营机构。本页尚未确认该项目的具体联系人。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

#: ../../funding/songjiang-data-2026.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布额度是最高限额，不代表申请即可获得。申报前请核对适用通知、认可的费用发生期间、已获其他财政支持及书面拨付条件。"
